{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Hide, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Station 77 </strong></i>is a fixed camera, survival horror game in which you are the sole survivor of a mysterious disaster aboard a deep space research vessel. After waking from cryosleep, you find the ship unresponsive and its systems offline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must now repair the ship's systems, and attempt to return home to Earth.\u00a0Explore the station, salvage and repair what you can, and uncover the mystery of the horrifying disaster that took place, all while evading the single fully dynamic, indestructible monster that prowls the halls.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using Unreal Engine 5</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374310?t=1758892628","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758892628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374310/1dfbf0d8a3a332b49ed6315c46069da5f88c08e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758892628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374310/1dfbf0d8a3a332b49ed6315c46069da5f88c08e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758892628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains infrequent PSX style corpses, horror elements, and occasional gore throughout."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Hide, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Station 77 </strong></i>is a fixed camera, survival horror game in which you are the sole survivor of a mysterious disaster aboard a dee